    <MESSAGE value="**Add Sebrus Mail support with modular SMTP server, admin portal, and mail portal features**&#10;&#10;- Introduced `mail-server` crate for SMTP inbound server implementation, authentication, and message handling.&#10;- Added Admin Portal for domain, account, and certificate management (`docs/design/ADMIN_PORTAL.md`).&#10;- Added Mail Portal UX for user mailbox interactions (`docs/design/MAIL_PORTAL.md`).&#10;- Updated seed data and roles with `Sebrus Mail Admin` functionality.&#10;- Cleaned up outdated IDE files and adjusted workspace member configuration for `sebrus_mail`." />
    <MESSAGE value="**Add Sebrus Mail portal and admin UI skeleton**&#10;&#10;- Introduced design documents for Sebrus Mail (`MAIL_PORTAL.md`, `ADMIN_PORTAL.md`) with UX details.&#10;- Implemented initial `mail-server` crate for SMTP handling and recipient resolution.&#10;- Added &quot;Sebrus Mail Admin&quot; role to seed data for admin access.&#10;- Updated workspace configurations to include `rust_apps/sebrus_mail` and `crates/mail-server`. &#10;- Cleanup: removed old `.idea` configuration files." />
    <MESSAGE value="Remove TLS certificate management from mail server:  &#10;- Eliminated `tls_cert` and `tls_key` fields and logic from `Domain` struct and database schema.  &#10;- Removed unused dependencies (`tokio-rustls`, `rustls-pemfile`) from `Cargo.toml`.  &#10;- Updated documentation to reflect the change, clarifying that TLS is managed by the ingress controller." />
